(40517,108,'2024-07-17 19:23:01','2024-07-18 01:23:01','Become authorized to use the denhac mig welder. The class will cover basic safety training regarding the MIG welder but will not be an exhaustive lesson on welding. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use the MIG machine.\r\n\r\n<strong>Attendees must wear non-synthetic clothing and shoes.</strong> Welding helmets, jackets, and gloves are provided, but you’re also welcome to bring your own.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Cost:</strong>\r\ndenhac <strong>members: Free!</strong>\r\n<strong>non members:</strong> If you\'re interested in this class you must first become a denhac member. First see our website: <a class="!text-viridian" href="https://denhac.org/howto" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener ugc">https://denhac.org/</a>. Think our organization sounds cool and interested in joining? Attend an <a class="!text-viridian" href="https://www.meetup.com/denhac-hackerspace/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open house tour</a>, every Tuesday 8 - 10pm. After your tour if you like our community - you can sign up, show us your official ID, and become a member.\r\n\r\nFind more information about our welders on our wiki:\r\n\r\nhttps://denhac.org/wiki/intro-to-mig-welding','MIG Welder Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','mig-welder-authorization-2024-07-24','','','2024-07-17 19:47:40','2024-07-18 01:47:40','',0,'https://denhac.org/events/mig-welder-authorization-2024-07-24',0,'event','',0),
