(55020,113,'2025-11-13 21:37:17','2025-11-14 04:37:17','Completing and Passing this class will authorize you to operate the metalworking lathes we have in the metal shop. We will go over basic setup and operation of the machine as well as some basic theory on machining. It\'s not required but highly recommended you be familiar with some basic machining concepts before taking this class.\r\n\r\nThere are resources online as well as some books and manuals in the metal shop area that are good starting resources for learning about operating these machines.  You are also encouraged to ask on slack in the <a class="c-link c-mrkdwn__channel c-member_slug internal_channel_link c-member_slug--link" href="https://denhac.slack.com/archives/C4H2U842E" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-channel-name="#help-metalwork" data-channel-id="C4H2U842E" data-qa="channel_link" data-stringify-type="channel" data-sk="tooltip_parent">#help-metalwork</a> channel for advice.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Metal Lathe Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','metal-lathe-authorization-class-3','','','2025-11-20 12:10:53','2025-11-20 19:10:53','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=55020',0,'event','',0),
