(63749,113,'2026-06-30 09:47:20','2026-06-30 15:47:20','Completing and Passing this class will authorize you to operate the metalworking lathes we have in the metal shop. We will go over basic setup and operation of the machine as well as some basic theory on machining. It\'s not required but highly recommended you be familiar with some basic machining concepts before taking this class.\r\n\r\nThere are resources online as well as some books and manuals in the metal shop area that are good starting resources for learning about operating these machines. You are also encouraged to ask on slack in the #help-metalwork channel for advice.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Metal lathe authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','metal-lathe-authorization-2','','','2026-07-14 20:17:44','2026-07-15 02:17:44','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=63749',0,'event','',0),
(67449,109,'2026-09-17 09:30:58','2026-09-17 15:30:58','<p class="mb-ds2-10">Speaker: Maya Douglas (Ace of Hearts)\r\n\r\nCTFs. The thrill of getting a flag is unmatched, but the narratives tend to be... flat. But they don\'t have to be! Play an analog-horror, ARG-style capture-the-flag set in the heart of Denver. OSINT, crypto, web app vulnerabilities unlock a story about how a fictional man went missing (mostly) without a trace.\r\n\r\nI\'ll walk you through the story and infrastructure before opening it up for live play. Difficulty is easy to medium. but experience is not necessary (I have non-cyber friends who solved this as well)! See you there.\r\n\r\n<b>Ask of the audience:</b> Bring a laptop. To participate, confirm that you have FTP, SSH, and nmap ready to go on your machine. Whether they\'re built-in depends on the operating system but the obvious answer is just use Linux.</p>','DC303 - Missing: Live-Playing an ARG-Style CTF','','publish','closed','closed','','dc303-missing-live-playing-an-arg-style-ctf','','','2026-09-17 09:30:58','2026-09-17 15:30:58','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=67449',0,'event','',0),
