(53745,238,'2025-10-09 15:23:08','2025-10-09 21:23:08','Open door meeting for the computer museum and retro technology.\r\n\r\nThese are low-key, open-door sessions to explore the vintage tech at denhac, share knowledge, and work on developing the computer museum. Whether you\'re new to retro computing or already into the hobby, this is a place to learn, collaborate, and help shape the next phase of the denhac computer museum. Drop in anytime. For the moment these will be free-form meetings with no set agenda. We can teach, game, chat, plan, code, repair, improve, build, solder, or anything of the like.\r\n\r\n<strong>Room:</strong> Fishbowl\r\n\r\n<strong>Slack:</strong> <em>#project-computer-museum</em>\r\n\r\nDon\'t forget that denhac also has Laserdiscs and vintage video game consoles. And the museum has a software PBX and some older networking tech.\r\n\r\nFeel free to reach out to <em>@joseph</em> or our channel on slack for questions/comments regarding this event.\r\n\r\n[caption id="attachment_53753" align="aligncenter" width="800"]<img class="size-full wp-image-53753" src="https://denhac.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/computer-museum-office-hours-event-image.jpg" alt="Computer Museum Office Hours" width="800" height="600" /> Computer Museum Office Hours[/caption]','Computer Museum Office Hours','Open door meeting for the computer museum and retro technology.','publish','closed','closed','','computer-museum-office-hours','','','2025-10-09 15:23:08','2025-10-09 21:23:08','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53745',0,'event','',0),
