(39150,484,'2024-05-29 14:13:11','2024-05-29 20:13:11','This training will cover our Shapeoko 5 and Nomad CNC machines.\r\n\r\n<strong>PREREQUISITES:</strong>\r\n\r\nRead our <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/cnc-training">CNC Training overview</a> and watch the videos it links to. You can probably watch them on 2x speed, but you are responsible for being familiar with this content prior to the start of class. We do not have time to go over all of this material in person.\r\n\r\nThis class is for members only.\r\n\r\nMore CNC materials are available on our <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/cnc">wiki</a>','CNC Router/Mill Training','Get authorized to use our Shapeoko 5 and Nomad CNC machines','publish','closed','closed','','cnc-router-mill-training','','','2024-05-29 20:11:45','2024-05-30 02:11:45','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=39150',0,'event','',0),
