(49315,686,'2025-05-25 13:54:00','2025-05-25 19:54:00','An introductory training class on the plasma cutter and how to cut with it. This class is intended for those who have little to no welding/plasma cutting experience. It will cover how to use the plasma cutter and how to cut straight lines and use jigs to cut specific shapes.\r\n\r\nThe plasma cutter does not require specific authorization. If you\'ve used one before, and have read the wiki page already, you may use it without taking this class.','Plasma Cutting 101 with Camron Anderson','','publish','closed','closed','','plasma-cutting-101','','','2025-08-31 18:13:53','2025-09-01 00:13:53','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=49315',0,'event','',0),
(49548,686,'2025-06-02 11:42:55','2025-06-02 17:42:55','This will cover the angle grinders, bench grinders, grizzly band saw, and the drill press.\r\n\r\nPlease do not wear loose clothing. Jeans and a T-shirt with closed toed shoes are best, hair needs to be pulled back. We have an assortment of used Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) but it is best to bring your own if you have it. This includes PPE like safety glasses, hearing protection, and gloves. Tank tops and v neckline shirts shouldn\'t be worn for the class\r\n\r\nThis class is available to all denhac members, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the metalshop, <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/metal-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw30aHX5zhonyMOZRjExxmcq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>','Introduction to Metal Shop Safety','','publish','closed','closed','','introduction-to-metal-shop-safety-2025-06-11','','','2025-08-31 18:13:28','2025-09-01 00:13:28','',0,'https://denhac.org/events/introduction-to-metal-shop-safety-2025-06-11',0,'event','',0),
