(41876,689,'2024-08-28 15:59:12','2024-08-28 21:59:12','The lathe turning class will demonstrate basic lathe safety, operation, and spindle turning. <strong>This class is required to operate the denhac wood lathe.</strong>\r\n\r\n<em>This class has <strong>limited attendance</strong> and generally has a waiting list. If you RSVP and <strong>decide not to go</strong>, please <strong>cancel your RSVP</strong> so the next person on the waiting list can attend!</em>\r\n\r\nTo read more about our Wood Lathe, <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/jet-1236-wood-lathe">checkout the wiki</a>.','Wood Lathe Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','wood-lathe-authorization-class-6','','','2024-08-28 16:01:49','2024-08-28 22:01:49','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=41876',0,'event','',0),
