(47532,689,'2025-03-30 00:15:16','2025-03-30 06:15:16','<em><strong>A wood lathe authorization is required for each attendee. Do not sign up for this class if you haven\'t been certified to use the wood lathe yet.</strong></em>\r\n\r\nThis class will demonstrate the basics of (safe) bowl turning and using the chuck attachment in the headstock.\r\n\r\nThis is just a demo, and may not include any hands on experience.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Bowl Turning Demo Class','','publish','closed','closed','','bowl-turning-demo-class','','','2025-04-26 19:55:11','2025-04-27 01:55:11','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=47532',0,'event','',0),
