(51376,689,'2025-07-31 14:15:15','2025-07-31 20:15:15','Get authorized to use our new woodshop band saw.\r\n\r\nOur old bandsaw did not require training, but sustained frequent damage. Training is now required to use the new one. Existing woodshop users are not grandfathered in and should sign up for this training.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Wood Bandsaw Training','Get authorized to use our new wood bandsaw','publish','closed','closed','','wood-bandsaw-training-3','','','2025-07-31 14:15:15','2025-07-31 20:15:15','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51376',0,'event','',0),
