(51380,689,'2025-07-31 14:20:31','2025-07-31 20:20:31','The lathe turning class will demonstrate basic lathe safety, operation, and spindle turning.\r\n\r\n<strong>This class is required to operate the denhac wood lathe.</strong> <em>This class has <strong>limited attendance</strong> and generally has a waiting list. If you RSVP and <strong>decide not to go</strong>, please <strong>cancel your RSVP</strong> so the next person on the waiting list can attend!</em>\r\n\r\nTo read more about our Wood Lathe, <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/jet-1236-wood-lathe&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw0z0At8zjoF7anwf-Oq_bmQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">checkout the wiki</a>.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Wood Lathe Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','wood-lathe-authorization-class-32','','','2025-07-31 14:20:31','2025-07-31 20:20:31','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51380',0,'event','',0),
(51383,689,'2025-07-31 14:22:50','2025-07-31 20:22:50','<em><strong>A wood lathe authorization is required for each attendee. Do not sign up for this class if you haven\'t been certified to use the wood lathe yet.</strong></em>\r\n\r\nThis class will demonstrate the basics of (safe) bowl turning and using the chuck attachment in the headstock. This is just a demo, and may not include any hands on experience.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Bowl Turning Demo','','publish','closed','closed','','bowl-turning-demo-2','','','2025-07-31 14:22:50','2025-07-31 20:22:50','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51383',0,'event','',0),
