(54429,689,'2025-10-29 10:58:07','2025-10-29 16:58:07','In this class we\'ll cover how to make a splined picture frame from start to finish, including how to properly lay out and design a frame to fit a piece of art. We\'ll then show how to measure and cut a mat, mount the art to the mat, and install it into the frame with custom sized acrylic glazing!','Picture Frame Making','','publish','closed','closed','','picture-frame-making','','','2025-10-29 10:59:27','2025-10-29 16:59:27','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=54429',0,'event','',0),
