(49455,745,'2025-05-29 09:19:01','2025-05-29 15:19:01','<em><strong>A wood lathe authorization is required for each attendee. Do not sign up for this class if you haven\'t been certified to use the wood lathe yet.</strong></em>\r\n\r\nThis class will demonstrate the basics of (safe) pen turning and using the pen mandrel. This is just a demo, and may not include any hands on experience. Although this training is not required to use the pen mandrel, the instructional class will definitely help if you\'ve never used one before.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Pen Turning Demo','','publish','closed','closed','','pen-turning-demo','','','2025-05-29 09:19:01','2025-05-29 15:19:01','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=49455',0,'event','',0),
