(46615,891,'2025-02-25 13:57:49','2025-02-25 20:57:49','Learn to use the <del>7-needle</del> <strong>Single Needle</strong> embroidery machine and get authorized to use it. This machine is able to CNC embroider fabrics but you\'ll need to change out the thread between each run.\r\n\r\nThis class is for denhac members only, and is provided at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo read more about the Embroidery Machines <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/seven-needle-embroidery-machine&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw0D_uJ3vXURmldUoxS8lf8S" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Edit: *Single* Embroidery Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','7-needle-embroidery-machine-authorization-class-9','','','2025-04-17 15:32:24','2025-04-17 21:32:24','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=46615',0,'event','',0),
