(48087,885,'2025-04-17 15:07:42','2025-04-17 21:07:42','Bring your own kit, or we\'ll provide one for an $8 donation to the Electronics SIG','Guided Introduction to Through-Hole Soldering','','publish','closed','closed','','guided-introduction-to-through-hole-soldering','','','2025-04-17 15:07:42','2025-04-17 21:07:42','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=48087',0,'event','',0),
(48218,906,'2025-04-21 18:10:57','2025-04-22 00:10:57','<strong>Only sign up for this class <em>after</em> you\'ve completed the homework section of the wiki.</strong>\r\n\r\nLearn to use the CNC Routers and get authorized to use them. The CNC Routers are capable of machining almost any material because it uses a spinning end mill to selectively remove stock material until you\'re left with your final part. These machines are most commonly used on sheets of plywood, hardwood, polycarbonate, acrylic, and aluminum.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our CNC Machines <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/cnc&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kFti8EPPxpAeN3kX3Lq_2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.\r\n\r\n<strong>HOMEWORK:</strong> <strong>On the</strong><strong> wiki page is a Homework section, you must watch the homework videos and familiarize yourself with everything before showing up to class.</strong> <strong>Although you can still take the class, you will need to know how to do CAD and CAM using Fusion 360 or some other workflow before you\'ll have any files to run on these machines. If you\'ve never used a CNC machine then please sign up for a CAD class or request one in the #compuer-aided-design channel before signing up for this CNC authorization.</strong>','CNC Router Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','cnc-router-authorization-class-21','','','2025-04-21 18:10:57','2025-04-22 00:10:57','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=48218',0,'event','',0),
(53901,885,'2025-10-14 14:17:43','2025-10-14 20:17:43','If you are interested in learning PCB design with KiCad, this is the class for you!\r\nIt will cover creating schematics and board layout, with some custom symbol and footprint creation. Bring a laptop with KiCad installed (or if you can\'t or don\'t want to install KiCad, there are browser-based tools that work similarly) and project ideas. For those who don\'t have projects in mind we\'ll have some sample projects.','PCB design class with KiCad','','publish','closed','closed','','pcb-design-class-with-kicad','','','2025-10-14 14:17:43','2025-10-14 20:17:43','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53901',0,'event','',0),
(57047,885,'2026-01-09 11:41:55','2026-01-09 18:41:55','<div id="C0DAR7Z9T-1767666503.240999-thread-list-Thread_1767825485.947599" class="c-virtual_list__item" tabindex="0" role="listitem" aria-setsize="-1" data-qa="virtual-list-item" data-item-key="1767825485.947599">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__message c-message_kit__thread_message" role="presentation" data-qa="message_container" data-qa-unprocessed="false" data-qa-placeholder="false" data-msg-ts="1767825485.947599" data-msg-channel-id="C0DAR7Z9T">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__hover" role="document" aria-roledescription="message" data-qa-hover="true">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__actions c-message_kit__actions--default">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter__right" role="presentation" data-qa="message_content">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text">\r\n<div class="c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text" data-qa="message-text">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer" data-qa="block-kit-renderer">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_block" dir="auto">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_section">This will be a guided class where we all lay out the same schematic and board design. We\'ll cover creating the schematic and lay out the PCB. At least 1 component will be custom.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id="C0DAR7Z9T-1767666503.240999-thread-list-Thread_1767825559.526259" class="c-virtual_list__item" tabindex="-1" role="listitem" aria-setsize="-1" data-qa="virtual-list-item" data-item-key="1767825559.526259">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__background--hovered c-message_kit__message c-message_kit__thread_message" role="presentation" data-qa="message_container" data-qa-unprocessed="false" data-qa-placeholder="false" data-msg-ts="1767825559.526259" data-msg-channel-id="C0DAR7Z9T">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__hover c-message_kit__hover--hovered" role="document" aria-roledescription="message" data-qa-hover="true">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__actions c-message_kit__actions--above">\r\n<div class="p-autoclog__hook">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter__right" role="presentation" data-qa="message_content">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text">\r\n<div class="c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text" data-qa="message-text">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer" data-qa="block-kit-renderer">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_block" dir="auto">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_section">Please install KiCAD on your laptop before you come to this class. If you can\'t or don\'t want to you can use a web-based tool like easyeda; the concepts will be similar but the tools may be different.</div>\r\n<div>\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge. If you\'re interested in becoming a denhac member then you should join us for a Tuesday night open house between 8 and 10pm.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','Intro to Circuit Design with KiCAD','','publish','closed','closed','','intro-to-circuit-design-with-kicad','','','2026-01-09 11:41:55','2026-01-09 18:41:55','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=57047',0,'event','',0),
(58158,885,'2026-02-07 19:41:08','2026-02-08 02:41:08','<div id="C0DAR7Z9T-1767666503.240999-thread-list-Thread_1767825485.947599" class="c-virtual_list__item" role="listitem" data-qa="virtual-list-item" data-item-key="1767825485.947599">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__message c-message_kit__thread_message" role="presentation" data-qa="message_container" data-qa-unprocessed="false" data-qa-placeholder="false" data-msg-ts="1767825485.947599" data-msg-channel-id="C0DAR7Z9T">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__hover" role="document" data-qa-hover="true">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__actions c-message_kit__actions--default">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__gutter__right" role="presentation" data-qa="message_content">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text">\r\n<div class="c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text" data-qa="message-text">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer" data-qa="block-kit-renderer">\r\n<div class="p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_block" dir="auto">\r\n<div class="p-rich_text_section">This will be a guided class where we all lay out the same schematic and board design. We\'ll cover creating the schematic and lay out the PCB. At least 1 component will be custom.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id="C0DAR7Z9T-1767666503.240999-thread-list-Thread_1767825559.526259" class="c-virtual_list__item" role="listitem" data-qa="virtual-list-item" data-item-key="1767825559.526259">\r\n<div class="c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__background--hovered c-message_kit__message c-message_kit__thread_message" role="presentation" data-qa="message_container" data-qa-unprocessed="false" data-qa-placeholder="false" data-msg-ts="1767825559.526259" data-msg-channel-id="C0DAR7Z9T">\r\n