(42052,920,'2024-09-05 15:52:38','2024-09-05 21:52:38','Learn to use the 7-needle embroidery machine and get authorized to use it.\r\n\r\nThis class is for denhac members only, and is provided at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo read more about the 7-Needle Embroidery Machine <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/seven-needle-embroidery-machine">read the wiki</a>.','7-Needle Embroidery Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','7-needle-embroidery-machine-authorization-class-4','','','2024-09-05 15:52:38','2024-09-05 21:52:38','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42052',0,'event','',0),
(42527,920,'2024-09-23 17:37:41','2024-09-23 23:37:41','Learn to use the Sergers and the Industrial Sewing Machine (and get authorized to use them both) in one convenient class.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Sergers or the Industrial Sewing Machine <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/serger-sewing-machines&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2opdkSLiWhz_x4n9JVQkL9">read </a>the <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/kingmax-gc-8700d-industrial-straight-stitch-sewing-machine">wiki</a>.','Serger & Industrial Sewing Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','serger-industrial-sewing-machine-authorization-class','','','2024-09-23 18:36:45','2024-09-24 00:36:45','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42527',0,'event','',0),
(42619,920,'2024-09-25 16:05:12','2024-09-25 22:05:12','Learn to use the Serger sewing machines and get authorized to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available at no charge to denhac members only.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Sergers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/serger-sewing-machines&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2opdkSLiWhz_x4n9JVQkL9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Serger Sewing Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','serger-sewing-machine-authorization-class-4','','','2024-09-25 16:05:49','2024-09-25 22:05:49','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42619',0,'event','',0),
(44361,920,'2024-11-29 12:05:41','2024-11-29 19:05:41','Learn to use the industrial sewing machine and get authorized to use it. This machine has the power to sew together almost any type of fabric, including things like velcro and leather.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Industrial Sewing Machine <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/kingmax-gc-8700d-industrial-straight-stitch-sewing-machine&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3x0ryiemnlUewXUDOMF65V" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Industrial Sewing Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','industrial-sewing-machine-authorization-class-4','','','2024-11-29 12:05:41','2024-11-29 19:05:41','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=44361',0,'event','',0),
(44618,920,'2024-12-09 18:28:29','2024-12-10 01:28:29','Learn to use the Single Needle Embroidery machine and get authorized to use it whenever you\'d like.\r\n\r\nThe embroidery machines are perfect for adding a high quality stitched image onto fabric but can only embroider one color at a time before needing to be swapped manually.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo read more about our Single Needle Embroidery machine, <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/single-needle-embroidery-machine&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3eSwTlIEGSDtJmPG7vUQ_v" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Single Needle Embroidery Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','single-needle-embroidery-machine-authorization-class-2','','','2024-12-09 18:28:29','2024-12-10 01:28:29','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=44618',0,'event','',0),
(44714,920,'2024-12-13 23:39:03','2024-12-14 06:39:03','Learn to use the 7-needle embroidery machine and get authorized to use it. This multi-needle machine is able to embroider with multiple colors of thread without having to rethread the machine for each color.\r\n\r\nThis class is for denhac members only, and is provided at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo read more about the 7-Needle Embroidery Machine <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/seven-needle-embroidery-machine&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw0D_uJ3vXURmldUoxS8lf8S" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','7-Needle Embroidery Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','7-needle-embroidery-machine-authorization-class-3','','','2024-12-13 23:39:03','2024-12-14 06:39:03','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=44714',0,'event','',0),
