(40777,968,'2024-08-01 13:32:31','2024-08-01 19:32:31','<p class="mb-4">Want to learn lock picking in a relaxed and social setting? All skill levels welcome, and we provide a community pool of tools and locks for borrowing during this hands-on class.</p>\r\n<p class="mb-4">Free and open to the public, but attendees must sign the waiver prior to participation:\r\nhttps://denhac.org/waiver</p>\r\nThis event can be found on <a href="https://www.meetup.com/denhac-hackerspace/events/mgsnhtygclbrb/">meetup.com</a> as well.','Locksport','','publish','closed','closed','','locksport','','','2024-08-01 13:33:33','2024-08-01 19:33:33','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=40777',0,'event','',0),
