(42796,968,'2024-10-01 14:55:12','2024-10-01 20:55:12','Learn to use the Prusas and get authorized to use them. FDM printing uses a plastic filament fed into a heated nozzle like a hot glue gun to deposit plastic until your part is complete. These machines are great for rapid prototyping with PLA, PETG, and TPU.\r\n\r\nThis class does not authorize users to use the Large Format 3d printers, but this class is a prerequisite for the advanced workshop that will teach you how to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our 3d printers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/3d-printing&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z7NYu6JokRmLMIg6nQBAM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','FDM 3d Printer Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','fdm-3d-printer-authorization-class-7','','','2024-10-02 15:42:10','2024-10-02 21:42:10','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42796',0,'event','',0),
(42803,968,'2024-10-01 15:39:33','2024-10-01 21:39:33','Learn to use the CNC Lasers and get authorized to use them. The laser cutters emit a high power infrared beam of light, reflect it off the mirrors on the gantry of the machine, and into your material encased by a stream of high pressure air to both ignite and extinguish a fire that precisely burns through material. These machines are perfect for engraving images onto and cutting precise and accurate shapes from flat sheets of material especially wood, leather, fabric, paper, acrylic, and more.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Lasers (including a more broad materials list) <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/laser-cutting&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2JZCHJVUrkGcucAEsGrtKt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Laser Cutter Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','laser-cutter-authorization-class','','','2024-10-01 15:40:52','2024-10-01 21:40:52','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42803',0,'event','',0),
(42804,968,'2024-10-01 15:47:14','2024-10-01 21:47:14','Learn to use the TIG Welder and get authorized to use it. This class will teach basic machine safety and introductory welding techniques that should prepare you to practice more on your own safely and confidently.\r\n\r\nUnlike the MIG machine that feeds the wire automatically and draws current through the filler material, the TIG machine requires precise movement of a Tungsten electrode and filler material supplied by hand. MIG is easier but TIG is cleaner and more precise, thus the MIG class is a recommended (but not required) prerequisite to this authorization class.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our TIG welder, <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/ahp-alphatig-welder&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PyQUZ225ziQyqT4JOZ74v" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','TIG Welder Authorization Training','','publish','closed','closed','','tig-welder-authorization-training','','','2024-10-01 15:47:14','2024-10-01 21:47:14','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42804',0,'event','',0),
(42806,968,'2024-10-01 16:18:48','2024-10-01 22:18:48','Learn to use the TIG Welder and get authorized to use it. This class will teach basic machine safety and introductory welding techniques that should prepare you to practice more on your own safely and confidently.\r\n\r\nUnlike the MIG machine that feeds the wire automatically and draws current through the filler material, the TIG machine requires precise movement of a Tungsten electrode and filler material supplied by hand. MIG is easier but TIG is cleaner and more precise, thus the MIG class is a recommended (but not required) prerequisite to this authorization class.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our TIG welder, <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/ahp-alphatig-welder&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PyQUZ225ziQyqT4JOZ74v" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','TIG Welder Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','tig-welder-authorization-class','','','2024-10-01 16:18:48','2024-10-01 22:18:48','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42806',0,'event','',0),
(42808,968,'2024-10-01 16:20:07','2024-10-01 22:20:07','Learn to use the Prusas and get authorized to use them. FDM printing uses a plastic filament fed into a heated nozzle like a hot glue gun to deposit plastic until your part is complete. These machines are great for rapid prototyping with PLA, PETG, and TPU.\r\n\r\nThis class does not authorize users to use the Large Format 3d printers, but this class is a prerequisite for the advanced workshop that will teach you how to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our 3d printers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/3d-printing&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z7NYu6JokRmLMIg6nQBAM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','FDM 3d Printer Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','fdm-3d-printer-authorization-class-8','','','2024-10-01 16:20:07','2024-10-01 22:20:07','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42808',0,'event','',0),
(42809,968,'2024-10-01 16:22:57','2024-10-01 22:22:57','Learn to use the CNC Routers and get authorized to use them. The CNC routers can be useful for machining parts precisely and accurately from a very wide range of materials, although these machines see wood and aluminum the most.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our CNC Machines <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/cnc-training" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.\r\n\r\nThis is just a safety and authorization class, CNC Machining is a broad topic that cannot be covered in a few hours. This class goes much more smoothly if everyone comes prepared with some understanding of the machine and CNC machining in general. There is homework in the wiki that must be completed before this taking this class in person. Just watch the videos under the \'Homework\' heading on the main cnc wiki page linked above (~15 minutes) if you have already booked your ticket.','CNC Router Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','cnc-router-authorization-class-7','','','2024-10-01 16:22:57','2024-10-01 22:22:57','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42809',0,'event','',0),
