(43323,968,'2024-10-21 14:49:47','2024-10-21 20:49:47','Learn to use the Prusas (Our fleet of desktop FDM 3d printers) and get authorized to use them.\r\n\r\nFDM printing uses a plastic filament fed into a heated nozzle like a hot glue gun to deposit plastic until your part is complete. These machines are great for rapid prototyping with PLA, PETG, and TPU. This class does not authorize users to use the Large Format 3d printers, but this class is a prerequisite for the advanced workshop that will teach you how to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our 3d printers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/3d-printing&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z7NYu6JokRmLMIg6nQBAM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','FDM 3d Printer Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','fdm-3d-printer-authorization-class-9','','','2024-10-29 15:00:55','2024-10-29 21:00:55','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=43323',0,'event','',0),
(43324,968,'2024-10-21 15:17:48','2024-10-21 21:17:48','Learn to use the CNC Routers and get authorized to use them.\r\n\r\nThe CNC routers can be useful for machining parts precisely and accurately from a very wide range of materials, although these machines see wood and aluminum the most.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our CNC Machines <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/cnc-training&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw145qq-fxVqmaz0YSjpfTnV" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.\r\n\r\nThis is just a safety and authorization class, CNC Machining is a broad topic that cannot be covered in a few hours. This class goes much more smoothly if everyone comes prepared with some understanding of the machine and CNC machining in general. There is homework in the wiki that must be completed before this taking this class in person. Just watch the videos under the \'Homework\' heading on the main cnc wiki page linked above (~15 minutes) if you have already booked your ticket.','CNC Router Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','cnc-router-authorization-class-9','','','2024-10-21 15:17:48','2024-10-21 21:17:48','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=43324',0,'event','',0),
