(46897,968,'2025-03-05 14:54:17','2025-03-05 21:54:17','<strong>Bring a \'carry-on\' sized personal item to wrap with Vinyl</strong> and learn the art of working with this amazing material!\r\n\r\nThis class will feature a professional demo and assistance from the professionals at 4th Dimension Wraps and Graphics. Members will also get to learn how to use the Cricut Vinyl cutters. Once the workshop is complete attendees will have some experience working with the material to coat a surface, as well has how to use the vinyl cutters to make and apply decals, as well as some of the considerations around vinyl like how to prepare surfaces for vinyl wrap.\r\n\r\nIf you like this type of event then please consider making a <a href="http://denhac.org/donate">donation to denhac</a>','Vinyl Wrapping Class','','publish','closed','closed','','vinyl-wrapping-class','','','2025-03-05 14:58:41','2025-03-05 21:58:41','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=46897',0,'event','',0),
(47527,974,'2025-03-30 00:04:19','2025-03-30 06:04:19','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-22','','','2025-03-30 00:04:19','2025-03-30 06:04:19','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=47527',0,'event','',0),
(47528,974,'2025-03-30 00:06:13','2025-03-30 06:06:13','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-23','','','2025-03-30 00:06:13','2025-03-30 06:06:13','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=47528',0,'event','',0),
