(51385,974,'2025-07-31 14:25:38','2025-07-31 20:25:38','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-36','','','2025-07-31 14:25:38','2025-07-31 20:25:38','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51385',0,'event','',0),
(52403,974,'2025-08-31 17:33:54','2025-08-31 23:33:54','<strong>New in September:</strong> With the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible.\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use 3 major woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>The router table will not be covered in this class, and is now part of Woodshop B.</strong>\r\n\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "A"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-a','','','2025-08-31 17:37:34','2025-08-31 23:37:34','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52403',0,'event','',0),
(52406,974,'2025-08-31 17:42:13','2025-08-31 23:42:13','<strong>New in September:</strong> With the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible.\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use 3 woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class will probably take 2-3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Router Table</li>\r\n 	<li>Band Saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Drum Sander</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "B"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-b','','','2025-08-31 17:53:42','2025-08-31 23:53:42','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52406',0,'event','',0),
