(41812,991,'2024-08-26 20:35:52','2024-08-27 02:35:52','Learn to use the CNC Lasers and get authorized to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available at no charge to denhac members only.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Lasers <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/laser-cutting">read the wiki</a>.','Laser Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','cnc-laser-authorization-class','','','2024-08-26 21:22:16','2024-08-27 03:22:16','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=41812',0,'event','',0),
