(62392,1070,'2026-05-26 10:48:17','2026-05-26 16:48:17','<strong><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="color: #ff3232;text-decoration: underline">Bookings open 7 days prior to event.</span></span></strong>\r\n\r\nWith the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings.\r\n\r\nThese classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible. This training will authorize you to use 3 woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools.\r\n\r\nRegister for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fdenhac.org%2Fwiki%2Fcategory%2Fequipment%2Fwood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;ust=1777774200000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wDo4x_6MjMy37owJZcE-C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class will probably take 2-3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Router Table</li>\r\n 	<li>Band Saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Drum Sander</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>This class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.</strong>','Woodshop Authorization "B"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-b-24','','','2026-05-26 10:48:17','2026-05-26 16:48:17','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=62392',0,'event','',0),
(65034,1070,'2026-08-01 12:24:36','2026-08-01 18:24:36','This training will authorize you to use 3 woodworking power tools. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nRegister for this training and complete your homework before the class by reading the woodshop wiki page and all woodshop tool wiki pages. This class takes 2-3 hours depending on the number of attendees and experience.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThis class includes:\r\n\r\nRouter Table\r\n\r\nLaguna Band Saw\r\n\r\nJet Drum Sander\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe tablesaw/planer/jointer/miter saw will not be covered and are part of Woodshop A.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization “B”','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-b-28','','','2026-08-01 12:24:36','2026-08-01 18:24:36','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=65034',0,'event','',0),
(65959,1070,'2026-08-21 23:10:13','2026-08-22 05:10:13','This training will authorize you to use denhac’s precision hand tools, namely the three hand planes, the chisel set, and the gents saw. All other hand tools do not require training authorization unless otherwise stated. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use the tools.\r\n\r\nRegister for this training and complete your homework before the class by reading the woodshop wiki page and the tool wiki pages. This class takes ~3 hours depending on the number of attendees and experience. You are strongly encouraged to take the sharpening authorization class prior to this class.\r\n\r\nThis class covers our precision chisel set, each of the #4, #6, and block planes, and the gents saw.\r\n\r\nThis class will not cover any of the power tools at denhac. The mitre saw, jointer, planer, and table saw are covered in Woodshop A. The router table, bandsaw, and drum sander are covered in Woodshop B.\r\n\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge. If you\'re interested in becoming a denhac member then stop by for a Tuesday night open house from 8-10pm!\r\n\r\n<strong>Host:</strong> <a href="https://denhac.org/member/Q9AZ">EHastings</a>','Hand Tool Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','hand-tool-authorization','','','2026-09-11 18:28:03','2026-09-12 00:28:03','',0,'https://denhac.org/events/hand-tool-authorization',0,'event','',0),
(66120,1070,'2026-08-26 10:58:54','2026-08-26 16:58:54','This training will authorize you to use 4 major woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and complete your homework before the class by reading the woodshop wiki page and all woodshop tool wiki pages. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience.\r\n\r\nThis class includes:\r\nDewalt compound sliding miter saw\r\nSaw Stop table saw\r\nPowermatic jointer\r\nGrizzly Planer\r\n\r\nThe router table/bandsaw/drum sander will not be covered in this class, and is now part of Woodshop B.\r\n\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "A"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-a-31','','','2026-08-26 12:04:03','2026-08-26 18:04:03','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=66120',0,'event','',0),
(66188,1070,'2026-08-26 23:54:46','2026-08-27 05:54:46','<strong>New in September:</strong> With the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible.\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use 3 woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class will probably take 2-3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Router Table</li>\r\n 	<li>Band Saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Drum Sander</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "B"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-b-32','','','2026-08-27 00:00:07','2026-08-27 06:00:07','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=66188',0,'event','',0),
(68633,1070,'2026-10-11 19:00:38','2026-10-12 01:00:38','<div><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="color: #ff3232;text-decoration: underline">Bookings open 7 days prior to event.</span></span></strong>\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use denhac’s precision hand tools, namely the three hand planes, the chisel set, and the gents saw. All other hand tools do not require training authorization unless otherwise stated. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use the tools. <br aria-hidden="true" /><br aria-hidden="true" />Register for this training and complete your homework before the class by reading the woodshop wiki page and the tool wiki pages. This class takes 3–4 hours depending on the number of attendees and experience. You are strongly encouraged to take the sharpening authorization class prior to this class. <br aria-hidden="true" /><br aria-hidden="true" />IMPORTANT: participants in the class must supply their own material, ideally a S2S piece of hardwood (think cherry or soft maple—nothing overly hard) no smaller than 4”x8”x1”. <br aria-hidden="true" /><br aria-hidden="true" />The class will utilize the following tools:</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>#4/#5 and#6/#7 bench planes</li>\r\n 	<li>Block plane</li>\r\n 	<li>Chisels (between 1/4” and 1”)</li>\r\n 	<li>Marking gauge (or combination square and marking knife)</li>\r\n 	<li>Gents saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Square</li>\r\n 	<li>Compass</li>\r\n 	<li>Pencil</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>All of the above will be available with denhac’s tools, but members are welcome to bring their own if they prefer. <br aria-hidden="true" /><br aria-hidden="true" />This class will not cover any of the power tools at denhac. The mitre saw, jointer, planer, and table saw are covered in Woodshop A. The router table, bandsaw, and drum sander are covered in Woodshop B.<br aria-hidden="true" /><br aria-hidden="true" />This class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.</div>','Hand Tool Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','hand-tool-authorization-2','','','2026-10-11 19:00:38','2026-10-12 01:00:38','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=68633',0,'event','',0),
(41880,1084,'2024-08-28 16:18:48','2024-08-28 22:18:48','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all tool wiki pages linked below</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Cost:</strong>\r\n\r\ndenhac members<strong>: Free!</strong>\r\n\r\nnon members<strong>:</strong> If you\'re interested in this class you must first become a <a href="http://denhac.org/">denhac</a> member. Attend an open house tour, every Tuesday 8 - 10pm. After your tour if you like our community - you can sign up, show us your official ID, and become a member.','General Wood Shop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-wood-shop-authorization-class-3','','','2024-08-28 16:18:48','2024-08-28 22:18:48','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=41880',0,'event','',0),
