(42795,1084,'2024-10-01 13:21:08','2024-10-01 19:21:08','Learn how and get authorized to use the Drum Sander!\r\n\r\nThis device is much like the planer that takes thin amounts of material off of sheets but the Drum Sander is much more delicate because it is sanding the surface as opposed to chipping away at it. This device can be very handy for laser projects where you want to remove charring from the surface, and for finishing things like cutting boards.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the drum sander, <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/jet-16-drum-sander">read the wiki</a>.','Drum Sander Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','drum-sander-authorization-class','','','2024-10-01 13:21:08','2024-10-01 19:21:08','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=42795',0,'event','',0),
