(46762,1084,'2025-03-01 15:43:37','2025-03-01 22:43:37','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience.\r\n\r\nThis class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge. If you\'re interested in becoming a denhac member, come to an open house or contact us','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-18','','','2025-03-01 15:47:30','2025-03-01 22:47:30','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=46762',0,'event','',0),
(50128,1084,'2025-06-22 09:41:53','2025-06-22 15:41:53','The Jugger Craft Day is a social crafting event open to denhac members and the public. It is a cross-community event to introduce Colorado Jugger teams to denhac, and invite members and the public to learn about Jugger.Jugger is a 5v5 game similar to rugby, but with foam swords instead of full body tackles. Jugger’s philosophy is “first touch, lightest touch” to judge engagements, and uses strict guides on building “pompfen” or “sticks” to maintain safety. Modeled after the recent Vinyl Wrapping Workshop, the Jugger Craft Day will help Jugger players repair gear and build new equipment, introduce them to the incredible space that is denhac, and invite denhac members to meet teams and join practices with a welcoming, diverse community.\r\n\r\nColorado has the most teams of any US state - with 13 teams practicing between Colorado Springs and Fort Collins - and is proud to host the US National Mile High Open competition on July 19-20. With 800 teams in Germany alone, and worldwide competitions in Australia (2025) and Berlin (2026), it’s the most fun, biggest sport you’ve never heard of - and we can’t wait to welcome you!\r\n\r\nLogistics:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>This event will take place in the Textiles Area within "The Fishbowl". It will have a non-exclusive reservation of the large textiles table. denhac members wishing to use the textiles area are welcome to work on their projects as usual, but should expect a crowd.</li>\r\n 	<li>Individual projects are expected to take up to ~45 minutes; <strong>participation over the entire event duration is not expected/required</strong>.</li>\r\n 	<li>This event is open to members of the public. <strong>Guests are required to sign our waiver</strong> at denhac.org/waiver prior to or upon entering our space</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-50131" src="https://denhac.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FUQVLINHZFDWFVD.jpg" alt="" width="270" height="190" /> <img class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-50130" src="https://denhac.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Drengr-vs.-Goats-300x200.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="200" />','Jugger Craft Workshop','Workshop for Jugger players to craft/repair equipment, and community members to learn about/get started with Jugger','publish','closed','closed','','jugger-craft-workshop','','','2025-06-22 09:41:53','2025-06-22 15:41:53','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=50128',0,'event','',0),
(50296,1084,'2025-06-27 08:31:44','2025-06-27 14:31:44','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-32','','','2025-06-27 08:51:05','2025-06-27 14:51:05','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=50296',0,'event','',0),
(51378,1084,'2025-07-31 14:17:15','2025-07-31 20:17:15','Get authorized to use our new woodshop band saw.\r\n\r\nOur old bandsaw did not require training, but sustained frequent damage. Training is now required to use the new one. Existing woodshop users are not grandfathered in and should sign up for this training.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Wood Bandsaw Training','Get authorized to use our new wood bandsaw','publish','closed','closed','','wood-bandsaw-training-5','','','2025-07-31 14:18:18','2025-07-31 20:18:18','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51378',0,'event','',0),
(51379,1084,'2025-07-31 14:17:38','2025-07-31 20:17:38','Get authorized to use our new woodshop band saw.\r\n\r\nOur old bandsaw did not require training, but sustained frequent damage. Training is now required to use the new one. Existing woodshop users are not grandfathered in and should sign up for this training.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Wood Bandsaw Training','Get authorized to use our new wood bandsaw','publish','closed','closed','','wood-bandsaw-training-6','','','2025-07-31 14:17:46','2025-07-31 20:17:46','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51379',0,'event','',0),
(52405,1084,'2025-08-31 17:38:25','2025-08-31 23:38:25','<strong>New in September:</strong> With the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible.\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use 3 major woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>The router table will not be covered in this class, and is now part of Woodshop B.</strong>\r\n\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "A"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-a-3','','','2025-08-31 17:38:25','2025-08-31 23:38:25','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52405',0,'event','',0),
(52413,1084,'2025-08-31 17:53:09','2025-08-31 23:53:09','Get authorized to use our new woodshop band saw.\r\n\r\nOur old bandsaw did not require training, but sustained frequent damage. Training is now required to use the new one. Existing woodshop users are not grandfathered in and should sign up for this training.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Wood Bandsaw Training','Get authorized to use our new wood bandsaw','publish','closed','closed','','wood-bandsaw-training','','','2025-08-31 17:53:09','2025-08-31 23:53:09','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52413',0,'event','',0),
