(41879,1119,'2024-08-28 16:17:20','2024-08-28 22:17:20','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all tool wiki pages linked below</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Cost:</strong>\r\n\r\ndenhac members<strong>: Free!</strong>\r\n\r\nnon members<strong>:</strong> If you\'re interested in this class you must first become a <a href="http://denhac.org/">denhac</a> member. Attend an open house tour, every Tuesday 8 - 10pm. After your tour if you like our community - you can sign up, show us your official ID, and become a member.','General Wood Shop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-wood-shop-authorization-class-2','','','2024-08-28 16:17:20','2024-08-28 22:17:20','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=41879',0,'event','',0),
