(43998,1093,'2024-11-15 21:24:27','2024-11-16 04:24:27','Become authorized to use the denhac MIG/Flux Core welder. This class will also provide an overview of some of the other equipment in the room.\r\n\r\nThe class will cover basic safety training regarding the MIG welder but will not be an exhaustive lesson on welding. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use the MIG machine. If you have never welded before you should absolutely take this class before you consider taking the TIG class.\r\n\r\n<strong>Attendees must wear non-synthetic clothing and shoes.</strong> Welding helmets, jackets, and gloves are provided, but you’re also welcome to bring your own.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the MIG welder at denhac, <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/lincoln-electric-125-hd-welder">read the wiki</a>.','MIG/FCAW Welder Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','mig-fcaw-welder-authorization-class','','','2024-11-15 21:32:57','2024-11-16 04:32:57','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=43998',0,'event','',0),
