(45957,1119,'2025-01-30 14:19:25','2025-01-30 21:19:25','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge. If you\'re interested in becoming a denhac member, come to an open house or contact us','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-13','','','2025-02-04 23:53:30','2025-02-05 06:53:30','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=45957',0,'event','',0),
(53457,1084,'2025-10-01 11:44:40','2025-10-01 17:44:40','<strong>New in September:</strong> With the addition of the band saw to the training-required list, we\'re breaking up the "General Woodshop Authorization Class" into two classes "Woodshop A" and "Woodshop B", and merging in bandsaw and drum sander trainings. These classes cover different equipment and do not build on each other, so the order in which you take them does not matter. We hope this new format will make classes shorter and more digestible.\r\n\r\nThis training will authorize you to use 3 woodworking power tools. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class will probably take 2-3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Router Table</li>\r\n 	<li>Band Saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Drum Sander</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Woodshop Authorization "B"','','publish','closed','closed','','woodshop-authorization-b-3','','','2025-10-01 11:44:40','2025-10-01 17:44:40','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53457',0,'event','',0),
(53458,1084,'2025-10-01 11:46:04','2025-10-01 17:46:04','Get authorized to use our new woodshop band saw.\r\n\r\nOur old bandsaw did not require training, but sustained frequent damage. Training is now required to use the new one. Existing woodshop users are not grandfathered in and should sign up for this training.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Wood Bandsaw Training','Get authorized to use our new wood bandsaw','publish','closed','closed','','wood-bandsaw-training-7','','','2025-10-01 11:46:04','2025-10-01 17:46:04','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53458',0,'event','',0),
(53522,1084,'2025-10-03 12:42:14','2025-10-03 18:42:14','The Woodworking SIG is piloting a Maintenance Training Series to teach interested members how to troubleshoot and fix tools in the woodshop. The series aims to equip members with the knowledge and know-how to get any tool back up and running, helping the woodshop spend more time operating at peak capacity, and empowering membership to work together and share knowledge.','Maintainer Series: Planer and Bandsaw','','publish','closed','closed','','maintainer-series-planer-and-bandsaw','','','2025-10-03 12:42:14','2025-10-03 18:42:14','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53522',0,'event','',0),
