(46140,1184,'2025-02-06 01:05:25','2025-02-06 08:05:25','Learn to use the Prusas (our fleet of desktop FDM 3d printers) and get authorized to use them. FDM printing uses a plastic filament fed into a heated nozzle like a hot glue gun to deposit plastic until your part is complete. These machines are great for rapid prototyping with PLA, PETG, and TPU.\r\n\r\nThis class does not authorize users to use the Large Format 3d printers, but this class is a prerequisite for the advanced workshop that will teach you how to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge, but you may always <a href="https://denhac.org/product-category/donation">donate to denhac</a>!\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our 3d printers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/3d-printing&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z7NYu6JokRmLMIg6nQBAM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','FDM 3d Printer Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','fdm-3d-printer-authorization-class-19','','','2025-02-06 01:06:04','2025-02-06 08:06:04','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=46140',0,'event','',0),
(46397,1184,'2025-02-16 20:18:15','2025-02-17 03:18:15','Learn to use the Prusas (Our fleet of desktop FDM 3d printers) and get authorized to use them.\r\n\r\nFDM printing uses a plastic filament fed into a heated nozzle like a hot glue gun to deposit plastic until your part is complete. These machines are great for rapid prototyping with PLA, PETG, and TPU.\r\n\r\nThis class does not authorize users to use the Large Format 3d printers, but this class is a prerequisite for the advanced workshop that will teach you how to use them.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge. To learn more about our 3d printers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/3d-printing&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z7NYu6JokRmLMIg6nQBAM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','FDM 3D Printer Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','fdm-3d-printer-authorization-class-20','','','2025-02-16 20:18:15','2025-02-17 03:18:15','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=46397',0,'event','',0),
