(47386,1131,'2025-03-23 22:51:37','2025-03-24 04:51:37','Learn to use the Serger sewing machines and get authorized to use them. The Sergers are perfect for finishing edges of garments. They trim and fold the edge of a garment before performing a multithreaded stitch that you can find at the edges of many t-shirts, for example.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about our Sergers <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/serger-sewing-machines&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw2opdkSLiWhz_x4n9JVQkL9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the wiki</a>.','Serger Sewing Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','serger-sewing-machine-authorization-class-5','','','2025-03-23 22:51:37','2025-03-24 04:51:37','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=47386',0,'event','',0),
