(48109,1131,'2025-04-17 15:35:49','2025-04-17 21:35:49','Learn to use the Industrial Sewing Machine and get authorized to use it. This machine is very powerful and capable of sewing through many things without missing a beat.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the industrial sewing machine, <a href="https://denhac.org/wiki/kingmax-gc-8700d-industrial-straight-stitch-sewing-machine">check out the wiki</a>.','Industrial Sewing Machine Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','industrial-sewing-machine-authorization-class-5','','','2025-04-17 15:35:49','2025-04-17 21:35:49','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=48109',0,'event','',0),
(48433,1119,'2025-04-28 17:45:27','2025-04-28 23:45:27','Get trained and signed off to use the 4 major woodworking power tools at denhac. This training is mandatory for all denhac members before you\'re allowed to use these tools. Register for this training and <strong>complete your homework</strong> <strong>before the class by reading <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://denhac.org/wiki/category/equipment/wood-working&amp;sa=D&amp;source=calendar&amp;usd=2&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hiqe9ZjxtZNT3fbPQtPoh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the woodshop wiki page</a> and all woodshop tool wiki pages</strong>. This class takes ~3 hours depending on number of attendees and experience. This class includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Saw Stop table saw</li>\r\n 	<li>Powermatic jointer</li>\r\n 	<li>Dewalt planer</li>\r\n 	<li>Router table</li>\r\n 	<li>And possibly the drum sander if there\'s still time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis class is offered to denhac members only, and at no additional charge','General Woodshop Authorization Class','','publish','closed','closed','','general-woodshop-authorization-class-26','','','2025-04-28 17:45:27','2025-04-28 23:45:27','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=48433',0,'event','',0),
