(53144,1227,'2025-09-22 17:00:02','2025-09-22 23:00:02','Get authorized to use our resin printers.\r\n\r\n<strong>You must bring your own respirator.</strong>\r\n\r\nThis class is for members only.\r\n\r\nFor more details, see the wiki:\r\n\r\nhttps://denhac.org/wiki/resin-printing-process\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Resin Printer Training','','publish','closed','closed','','resin-printer-training-3','','','2025-09-22 17:00:02','2025-09-22 23:00:02','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=53144',0,'event','',0),
