(54154,1318,'2025-10-22 19:19:36','2025-10-23 01:19:36','Come learn to make stained glass with us!\r\n\r\nIn this introductory workshop, you\'ll learn the essentials of glass cutting, foil wrapping, and soldering in order to make your very own stained glass project.\r\n\r\nMaterials are provided. You\'re welcome to think about a pattern you might want to make. We do have some pre-made Halloween patterns for the month of October!\r\n\r\nLogistical notes: We have staggered start times, attendance for the entire event duration is not required. Plan for your project to take about 1.5-2 hours of work. The soldering process can create a bottleneck. Please be prepared for a wait at some workstations, depending on attendance. Consider bringing something to keep you busy if a line forms.  Join <a class="c-link c-mrkdwn__channel c-member_slug internal_channel_link c-member_slug--link" href="https://denhac.slack.com/archives/C08HF2H4DHN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-channel-name="#stained-glass" data-channel-id="C08HF2H4DHN" data-qa="channel_link" data-stringify-type="channel" data-sk="tooltip_parent">#stained-glass</a> on slack for more information.\r\n\r\nThis event is for denhac members only, at no additional cost.','Intro to Stained Glass','Make your own stained glass project - materials provided!','publish','closed','closed','','intro-to-stained-glass-8','','','2025-10-28 18:51:46','2025-10-29 00:51:46','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=54154',0,'event','',0),
(56059,1318,'2025-12-11 21:38:59','2025-12-12 04:38:59','Come make stained glass with us! To celebrate the holidays we have some festive premade patterns.\r\n\r\nIn this introductory workshop, you\'ll learn the essentials of glass cutting, foil wrapping, and soldering in order to make your very own stained glass project.\r\n\r\nMaterials are provided. You\'re welcome to think about a pattern you might want to make.\r\n\r\nLogistical notes: We have staggered start times, that is why there are multiple events back to back. Plan for your project to take about 1.5-2 hours of work. If we are not busy, walk-ins are welcome. The soldering process can create a bottleneck. Please be prepared for a wait at some workstations, depending on attendance. Consider bringing something to keep you busy if a line forms.  Join <a class="c-link c-mrkdwn__channel c-member_slug internal_channel_link c-member_slug--link" href="https://denhac.slack.com/archives/C08HF2H4DHN" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-channel-name="#stained-glass" data-channel-id="C08HF2H4DHN" data-qa="channel_link" data-stringify-type="channel" data-sk="tooltip_parent">#stained-glass</a> on slack for more information.\r\n\r\nThis event is for denhac members only, at no additional cost.','Holiday Stained Glass','Make your own stained glass project - materials provided!','publish','closed','closed','','holiday-stained-glass','','','2025-12-11 21:38:59','2025-12-12 04:38:59','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=56059',0,'event','',0),
