(57051,1318,'2026-01-09 12:38:47','2026-01-09 19:38:47','Do you want to work on your stained glass project while being social? This event is for you! A group of us will be working on our personal projects together. We will try to set up the ring saw, glass grinder, and beetle bits cutting system. We will also work together to clean up the lava room afterwards.\r\n\r\nExperienced glass hackers will attend and be able to provide advice, however this is not meant to be a comprehensive class. For detailed instruction please check out a stained glass workshop!\r\n\r\nJust show up, no reservations required. This event is for denhac members only.','Stained Glass Coworking','Stained Glass Coworking - come be social while working on your personal project! ','publish','closed','closed','','stained-glass-coworking','','','2026-01-09 19:18:34','2026-01-10 02:18:34','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=57051',0,'event','',0),
