(64817,1449,'2026-07-28 03:19:47','2026-07-28 09:19:47','The lathe turning class will demonstrate basic lathe safety, operation, and spindle turning.\r\n\r\nThis class is required to operate the denhac wood lathe. This class has limited attendance and generally has a waiting list. If you RSVP and decide not to go, please cancel your RSVP so the next person on the waiting list can attend!\r\n\r\nTo read more about our Wood Lathe, checkout the wiki.\r\n\r\nThis class is available to denhac members only, and at no additional charge.','Wood Lathe Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','wood-lathe-authorization','','','2026-08-03 11:36:29','2026-08-03 17:36:29','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=64817',0,'event','',0),
