(66809,1480,'2026-09-09 18:56:14','2026-09-10 00:56:14','THIS EVENT HAS BEEN CANCELED\r\n\r\nJoin us at this beginner friendly sewing class to learn to sew the gift of sleep as we make Sleep Masks! This is your call to cultivate or expand your homemade gift giving potential\r\n\r\nThis class is open to all levels, from ‘never touched a sewing machine’ to \'pro-sewist who just wants a little accountability to make a simple gift’.\r\n\r\nWe will cover the basics of using a domestic sewing machine as we sew, and also incorporate an elastic band into our project.\r\n\r\nAll materials and a fake candle for excellent class vibes will be provided.\r\n\r\nThis marks the first of a monthly series of make-and-take classes themed around homemade gift giving, because Amazon is sew out and thoughtfully creating with love is sew in.','[CANCELED] Homemade Gifts 100 - Sleep Masks','','publish','closed','closed','','homemade-gifts-100-sleep-masks','','','2026-09-12 12:19:49','2026-09-12 18:19:49','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=66809',0,'event','',0),
