(67917,1480,'2026-09-30 19:07:32','2026-10-01 01:07:32','Join Danielle to learn how to use both the industrial and home sergers.\r\n\r\nYou will be authorized to use all sergers once the class is complete.\r\n\r\nSkills needed: none, but you want lots of patience because you’ll be threading a couple of needles','Industrial Serger Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','industrial-serger-authorization-12','','','2026-09-30 19:07:32','2026-10-01 01:07:32','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=67917',0,'event','',0),
