(51720,1515,'2025-08-12 08:48:47','2025-08-12 14:48:47','Sig Textiles is happy to announce its first couture technique class for pattern and fabric cutting.\r\n\r\nIn this class you will have a chance to learn the various grain direction of fabric, how to quickly efficiently and precisely cut out patterns, techniques to protect your physical health when pattern cutting, how to cut patterns out of existing garments like kimonos and so much more.\r\n\r\nThis is a demo lecture class with plenty of opportunities for questions and answers.','Couture sewing techniques: Cutting patterns and fabrics','','publish','closed','closed','','couture-sewing-techniques-cutting-patterns-and-fabrics','','','2025-08-12 09:16:11','2025-08-12 15:16:11','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51720',0,'event','',0),
(51722,1515,'2025-08-12 08:50:21','2025-08-12 14:50:21','Sig Textiles is happy to announce its first couture technique class for pattern and fabric cutting.\r\n\r\nIn this class you will have a chance to learn the various grain direction of fabric, how to quickly efficiently and precisely cut out patterns, techniques to protect your physical health when pattern cutting, how to cut patterns out of existing garments like kimonos and so much more.\r\n\r\nThis is a demo lecture class with plenty of opportunities for questions and answers.','Couture sewing techniques: Cutting patterns and fabrics','','publish','closed','closed','','couture-sewing-techniques-cutting-patterns-and-fabrics-2','','','2025-08-12 09:17:21','2025-08-12 15:17:21','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51722',0,'event','',0),
