(51957,1569,'2025-08-18 15:22:43','2025-08-18 21:22:43','Covers the following topics: pattern cutting, pinning, sewing, stuffing','Intro to Sewing Projects','[Optional training] Learn to sew with a machine','publish','closed','closed','','intro-to-sewing','','','2025-09-02 14:35:13','2025-09-02 20:35:13','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=51957',0,'event','',0),
(52415,1569,'2025-08-31 18:03:40','2025-09-01 00:03:40','Class will include: tracing, pinning, cutting, stuffing, and sewing. You will complete a finished product in class.\r\n\r\nThis class will not authorize you to use the industrial sewing machine, but you will learn how to get a project from start to finish. Industrial sewing authorization is not required for this class, as we\'ll be using the basic sewing machines (no authorization required).','Intro to Sewing Projects','[Optional training] Learn to sew with a machine','publish','closed','closed','','intro-to-sewing-2','','','2025-09-02 14:34:48','2025-09-02 20:34:48','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52415',0,'event','',0),
(52588,1569,'2025-09-05 11:40:18','2025-09-05 17:40:18','Class will include: tracing, pinning, cutting, stuffing, and sewing. You will complete a finished product in class.\r\n\r\nThis class will not authorize you to use the industrial sewing machine, but you will learn how to get a project from start to finish. Industrial sewing authorization is not required for this class, as we\'ll be using the basic sewing machines (no authorization required).','Intro to Sewing Projects 100','[Optional training] Learn to sew with a machine','publish','closed','closed','','intro-to-sewing-projects-100','','','2025-09-05 11:40:18','2025-09-05 17:40:18','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=52588',0,'event','',0),
