(63758,1579,'2026-06-30 15:03:34','2026-06-30 21:03:34','Want a decorative hood for a cosplay, ren faire outfit, or just to keep your ears cozy while the rest of you stays cool?\r\n\r\nJoin Bekah to make a fully-lined hood with an optional secret pocket.\r\n\r\nDomestic sewing machine experience is recommended but not required. You\'ll learn how to measure and cut out a pattern, sew curved and straight seams, and attach a lining to your piece.','Make and Take 200 - Lined Hood','','publish','closed','closed','','make-and-take-200-lined-hood','','','2026-06-30 15:03:34','2026-06-30 21:03:34','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=63758',0,'event','',0),
