(63916,1753,'2026-07-03 21:13:01','2026-07-04 03:13:01','This will cover the angle grinders, bench grinders, grizzly band saw, and the drill press.\r\n\r\nPlease do not wear loose clothing. Jeans and a T-shirt with closed toed shoes are best, hair needs to be pulled back. We have an assortment of used Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) but it is best to bring your own if you have it. This includes PPE like safety glasses, hearing protection, and gloves. Tank tops and v neckline shirts shouldn\'t be worn for the class\r\n\r\nThis class is available to all denhac members, and at no additional charge.\r\n\r\nPlease be punctual. Members arriving late may be required to reschedule for a later class due to missed material.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about the metalshop, read the wiki','Metalshop Safety','','publish','closed','closed','','metalshop-safety-2','','','2026-07-14 20:21:47','2026-07-15 02:21:47','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=63916',0,'event','',0),
(63963,1753,'2026-07-05 12:31:42','2026-07-05 18:31:42','Come join Jamie to learn how to make a simple pair of drawstring pants!\r\n\r\nYou will need your hip, waist, and inseam measurements to participate.\r\n\r\nYou will work with a pre-cut pants pattern, which you will adjust and refine to match your measurements before cutting your fabric.\r\n\r\nYou may use a home sewing machine, industrial sewing machine, or serger to construct and finish your pants. Please note that no machine training will be provided during this class. You must already be authorized to use industrial machines or the serger. Home sewing machines will be available and do not require prior authorization.\r\n\r\nYou can use hackable fabric provided by the space or bring your own if you would like to use something specific.','Garment Making - Pants','','publish','closed','closed','','garment-making-pants-2','','','2026-07-21 12:04:37','2026-07-21 18:04:37','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=63963',0,'event','',0),
(65091,1753,'2026-08-03 11:32:25','2026-08-03 17:32:25','Join Jamie to learn how to use both the industrial and home sergers.\r\n\r\nYou will be authorized to use all sergers once the class is complete.\r\n\r\nSkills needed: none, but you want lots of patience because you’ll be threading a couple of needles','Industrial Serger Authorization','','publish','closed','closed','','industrial-serger-authorization-9','','','2026-08-05 16:36:50','2026-08-05 22:36:50','',0,'https://denhac.org/?post_type=event&p=65091',0,'event','',0),
